        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Sinatra\n- Works: Sinatra: London, From Here to Eternity\n- Organizations: BBC Radio\n- Places: Royal Albert Hall, Royal Festival Hall\n- Events: concerts, recording sessions, awards\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Sinatra's career was reborn in 1953 with the success of From Here to Eternity.\n- Frank Sinatra won the Academy Award and the Golden Globe Award for Best Supporting Actor for his performance in From Here to Eternity.\n- Sinatra: London includes live material from a 1953 session on BBC Radio's The Show Band Show.\n- Sinatra: London includes two DVD concerts recorded at the Royal Festival Hall in 1962 and 1970.\n- Sinatra: London includes a full concert recorded at the Royal Albert Hall in 1984.",
